{
  "id": "tieba_7741566573",
  "title": "水养，从发芽到开花，有点意外",
  "cat": "养花日常",
  "source": "tieba",
  "seq": 1248,
  "type": "月季",
  "thumb": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/tieba_7741566573_001.webp",
  "tag": "22",
  "author": "天真的小小之歌",
  "segments": [
    {
      "t": "水养，从发芽到开花，有点意外"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/a465edf25297c8f2f3314ff964f5b9e7.webp"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/ee01eaf17258bd92dd450831af3221b9.webp"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/tieba_7741566573_002.webp"
    },
    {
      "t": "过了几天，发芽了"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/f55dbe290c48f2c370dbd53a9c6c2d71.webp"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/42c0169a06e5040d06b122a09fb694f4.webp"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/tieba_7741566573_001.webp"
    },
    {
      "t": "本来只是玩玩，当个水养绿植那样的，但没想到过了几天长出了花苞"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/2ce84d7e4c4edba1b108a48e48a59a15.webp"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/86cb7bdb07fd2ab1249add4a15c2c9e2.webp"
    },
    {
      "t": "然后我认真一点了，换水➕晒太阳，花苞越长越大"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/38d04801735cc98e9e99bcd3cd330ee7.webp"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/24bcc3016b7a10cbd309a0dab71ea1d4.webp"
    },
    {
      "t": "后来我看它花苞一直打不开，可能营养不够，毕竟只靠着枝条里储存的营养。于是给它手动剥掉萼片，但是萼片摸着却很软，花瓣也黄绿色的，我以为要营养终于用完了要挂了"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/afd7b8080c1827625ccb1bc9e5b10a35.webp"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/e4c54389e68b2799b57ab0ad4ebdbe43.webp"
    },
    {
      "t": "没想到过了两天花苞突然转红膨大，看来是有希望的"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/f0efb557d6d376667ced2a6063469b28.webp"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/ddfce799e9c73a3868c3bbfacfdb9b84.webp"
    },
    {
      "t": "然后第二天更粉更大了，晒了一会儿太阳就打开了。最开始是野蔷薇的甜甜的香味，过一会儿转成香蕉、青苹果、野蔷薇混合香，但是非常淡"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/cde506876dd6753f61e957e7c89178ad.webp"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/73207f06ab71117e4fcc6b6fe2cbd193.webp"
    },
    {
      "t": "就这样打开了！ 有点像粉团蔷薇 谢谢，粉团蔷薇整过容 从发芽一路生长到现在，很多报纸和杂志给了我很多很好的评价，其中一个让花印象最深刻的，就是他们说淡妆不是天才，淡妆是地才。世界上没有很多很棒的不可能天才就在你身边，但是我一直很相信努力一定会成功"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/ec048bef4a5315a04c22a40d8137e514.webp"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/c2f351608fbc90959b6b4ddd3369f609.webp"
    },
    {
      "t": "第二天也就是今天，花色淡了一点，打开得大了一点，拍个照留念"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/c80503a7dd8bf532e5c78c918473d9bf.webp"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/911fa2ffb51afc68c02724796abbe8ef.webp"
    },
    {
      "t": "拉上它没开花的兄弟枝条一起拍个照"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/f176df86f35f3c27df9ff8870fcce35f.webp"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/bb8cc5eb3dfdcebcff47ffdd68993967.webp"
    },
    {
      "t": "下面那朵也开了，怪丑的"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/76a1fa69594d21fdc628483545edb0f5.webp"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/3227c77764555194131cfe82c9fc8c27.webp"
    },
    {
      "t": "侧蕾也开了，应该还是缺乏营养的缘故，比较小、单薄。没有根，能开这么几朵就真的挺不错了"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/0388eff2b554ead350d14d31f793e202.webp"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/1f859763d751976572464cb420bfcf5f.webp"
    }
  ],
